---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 | Page not found (probably stepped on)">
	<main>
		<h1>4 0 4</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Well, this isn't great. We searched every brick, every stud, and even under the
			rug — this page doesn't exist.
		</p>
		<ul class="reasons">
			<li>You lost the instruction booklet (it's always the last step).</li>
			<li>Someone stepped on this URL and it's now in excruciating pain.</li>
			<li>The page went for a swim in the brick bin, never to be found again.</li>
			<li>You simply snapped it apart with one of those little red plastic separators.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			<a href="/" class="btn">Build your way back home</a>
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	main {
		padding: 32px 24px;
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		text-align: center;
		font-family: Inter, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Arial Nova', 'Nimbus Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 48px;
		line-height: 1.1;
		color: #111827;
		margin: 0 0 8px;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
	}

	.lede {
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #111827;
		margin: 0 0 16px;
	}

	.reasons {
		text-align: left;
		color: #374151;
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 15px;
		margin: 0 0 24px;
		padding-left: 20px;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 12px;
		color: #fff;
		background: #e3000b;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		padding: 10px 20px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #9a0007;
		transition: transform 0.05s ease, box-shadow 0.05s ease;
	}

	.btn:hover {
		text-decoration: none;
		transform: translateY(2px);
		box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #9a0007;
	}

	.btn:active {
		transform: translateY(4px);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 #9a0007;
	}
</style>
